{"id":283213715,"title":"7.day7-文件读写-面向对象","summary":"第一章.文件操作1.操作文件","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678870657-ba9eda11-cabe-4927-a071-707a2d45b251.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第一章.文件操作</h1>\n<h2>1.操作文件</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678440995-832d483a-7cf4-446f-b0ee-56acad983c03.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678469450-eb69b0e3-0fa3-4fb5-9d59-dda1b2eaf906.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678482196-4d9fe5ba-9a96-46f1-b16e-b8dbb2d43147.png\" alt=\"\"> <img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678492279-f08142cb-b21b-48b3-b564-2cac77b6a24c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678500387-3739e0cb-6102-4ba7-8758-21adc8c8cda2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788678570361-640dd3d6-af9f-44d7-8354-064137781330.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788679891457-b43031b9-1393-40a4-8239-9c9248c24fcd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788679885631-facee474-8262-43fb-bac1-d387403003d4.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681014917-51bd8bf2-f07d-4bdc-bbb2-052c3927eac7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681166920-a727b6b6-d95f-4bdd-bb6b-03e81928487b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.文件复制</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788679900666-ef2af051-fc46-40e1-b0de-13f155b88e6c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681256410-c1e4925c-6885-4518-b302-bae8563e5ed8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788682065162-54cbb07d-48b8-4665-8a0e-6bbf6f2c2554.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里不是空字符串而是空字节串<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788682319725-ae53c4cb-2ee7-453b-9541-733243bfa9b3.png\" alt=\"\">要加一个b。</p>\n<h1>第二章.扩展知识点</h1>\n<h2>1.python中的False值</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681302436-02dc7f97-1cb0-4ea5-bf3a-835c08e0635a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.改造文件操作中的读文件操作</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681353704-9f845411-90b0-4d84-b6aa-cce5346251e7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>3.改造文件操作中的文件复制</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681360221-4ba495fc-54c7-4274-b0fa-09f98566b0c4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第三章.浅拷贝和深拷贝</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681378084-1fe5881c-3712-4fd4-b274-5845df28f793.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681671516-69822d96-d011-4b16-a0d0-8130fb9a87e9.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681677190-a82efcd4-321a-4df9-b2e4-6b8897e7f6c5.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681684938-8d7be356-94aa-410c-b3a0-9a0027751f49.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第四章.面向对象介绍</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788681701276-e6a